<title>USA: Ky. Interlocal School won by Ross, Sinclaire.</title>
<headline>Ky. Interlocal School won by Ross, Sinclaire.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ross, Sinclaire &amp; Associates, Inc said it won $4 million of Kentucky Interlocal School Transportation, lease program revenue bonds, with a rate of 4.85 percent for the $3.600 million convertible rate bonds and a rate of 6.00 percent for the $400,000 fixed rate bonds.</p>
</text>
